# Web3Forms access key (server-only — used by app/api/feedback/route.ts).
# 1. Create a key at https://web3forms.com with kabuyatambwe03@gmail.com
#    so submissions are forwarded to that inbox.
# 2. Paste the key below for local `npm run dev`.
# 3. In Vercel: Project → Settings → Environment Variables →
